{
  "description": "Chief home resolution shared by the cmux-next app (ChiefHome.swift) and the cmux CLI (cmux-tui cli/chief/home.rs). `tag` is the app's build tag; the CLI reads it from CMUX_TAG. `isolated` null: the app and the CLI may differ (an explicit home). `environment.CMUX_BUNDLE_ID` is the app's bundle id (the app's own; the CLI reads it from the app terminal's variable); a DEV build's home is named by its build key (BuildIdentity), so two copies of one bundle id with their own tags never share a Chief.",
